4	/*
5	 * Mechanism D, event and stats logs (DESIGN.md Section 5): two append-only
6	 * logs of segment files, events/seg-NNNNNN.pel and stats/seg-NNNNNN.pel,
7	 * each record framed as
8	 *     [len u32][type u16][ver u16][payload: len bytes][crc32 u32]
9	 * with the CRC over header + payload. Native little-endian (Pi 5 and the lab
10	 * machines are both LE). Recovery at open truncates the newest segment of
11	 * each log at the first record with a bad length or CRC, and closes any
12	 * ENTRY that was opened but never closed as interrupted (power lost).
13	 */
